[00:30.14]1. Jehovah, you always have been,
[00:35.32]And always you will be.
[00:42.14]You’ve given the throne to your Son;
[00:47.38]He rules by your decree.
[00:54.52]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[00:59.16]His rulership will fill the earth.
[01:01.72](Chorus)
[01:04.28]For now have come to pass
[01:09.48]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[01:14.04]The Kingdom is in place.
[01:19.42]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
[01:25.68]2. The time for the Devil is short;
[01:30.38]We know what this will mean.
[01:34.86]Though living in times of distress,
[01:39.48]We see the things unseen.
[01:44.32]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[01:48.80]His rulership will fill the earth.
[01:51.11](Chorus)
[01:53.42]For now have come to pass
[01:58.00]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[02:02.72]The Kingdom is in place.
[02:09.21]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
[02:19.21]3. The angels in heaven rejoice
[02:23.21]And sing with joyful cries.
[02:27.21]The heavens above are relieved
[02:32.21]From Satan and his lies.
[02:34.11]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[02:38.44]His rulership will fill the earth.
[02:42.77](Chorus)
[02:47.11]For now have come to pass
[02:51.11]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[02:55.11]The Kingdom is in place.
[02:59.00]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”